  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Energy Fund for Africa (SEFA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will support delivery of an energy project using a grant to the African Development Bank&#x2019;s (AfDB) trust fund Sustainable Energy Fund for Africa (SEFA). SEFA is supporting the Moyi Power project and this will help them reach financial close. This is a DRC priority project, contributing to their Mission 300 compact &#x2013; a pledge within the World Bank&#x2019;s initiative to connect 300 million people to electricity by 2030. In future years, UK would support through diplomatic/policy engagement and advisory support.</narrative>
  </description>
